        Name: 轴向旋转涡流 (Vortex Field)
        Description: 围绕指定三维轴线驱动粒子做切向飞旋龙卷运动
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: VortexField] 轴向切向旋转\n    float3 normAxis = normalize(u_VortexAxis.xyz);\n    float3 tangential = cross(normAxis, p.Position);\n    p.Velocity += tangential * (u_VortexStrength * dt);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: VortexAxis
            Type: 2
            FloatVal: 0
            VecVal: [0, 1, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: -1
            Max: 1
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 涡流旋转轴向量
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: VortexStrength
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 4
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: -30
            Max: 30
            Step: 0.200000003
            Tooltip: 旋转切向角速度强度
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.curl_noise
        Name: 3D 旋度噪声场 (Curl Noise Turbulence)
        Description: 基于无散度 3D 旋度噪声向量场驱动真实的流体涡流混沌运动
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: CurlNoiseTurbulence] 3D 无散度流体涡流场\n    float3 curl = CurlNoise3D(p.Position * u_NoiseFrequency);\n    p.Velocity += curl * (u_NoiseStrength * dt);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: NoiseStrength
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 3
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 30
            Step: 0.200000003
            Tooltip: 噪声场作用力强度
            IsExposed: true
            ExposedName: TurbulenceStrength
          - Name: NoiseFrequency
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.800000012
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0.0500000007
            Max: 10
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 空间采样频率 (波长缩放)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.drag
        Name: 空气阻力 (Air Drag)
        Description: 模拟流体介质空气阻尼，阻碍粒子高速运动
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: LinearDrag]\n    p.Velocity *= max(0.0f, 1.0f - u_LinearDrag * dt);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: LinearDrag
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.5
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 10
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 空气阻尼系数
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.scale_over_life
        Name: 尺寸随寿命缩放 (Scale Over Life)
        Description: 基于归一化存活进度 (0~1) 控制粒子尺寸膨胀扩散或缩小消亡
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: Scale Over Life]\n    float normLife = clamp(1.0f - (p.Life / max(0.001f, p.MaxLife)), 0.0f, 1.0f);\n    p.Size = lerp(u_StartScale, u_EndScale, normLife);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: StartScale
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.119999997
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 初始尺寸乘子
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: EndScale
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.0199999996
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 消亡前终止尺寸乘子
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.solve_velocity
        Name: "物理积分与生命周期 (Solve Velocity & Life)"
        Description: 欧拉物理速度积分更新位置，递减生命周期并计算归一化时间
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: SolveVelocity] 物理欧拉积分与消亡\n    p.Position += p.Velocity * dt;\n    p.Life -= dt;\n    if (u_SpeedDamping > 0.001f)\n        p.Velocity *= max(0.0f, 1.0f - u_SpeedDamping * dt);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: SpeedDamping
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 5
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 物理速度阻尼
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.render.sprite
        Name: 精灵渲染器 (Sprite Renderer)
        Description: 配置图元混合模式 (加法/半透)、自发光强度与面片朝向 (相机对齐/水平地面)
        Stage: Render
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: SpriteRenderer]\n    // 驱动 GPU 混合模式与几何着色器面片顶点朝向生成\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: BlendMode
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 1
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 1
            Tooltip: 混合模式 (0=半透 AlphaBlend, 1=加法 Additive)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: FacingMode
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 2
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 1
            Tooltip: 面片朝向 (0=Billboard相机对齐, 1=Horizontal地面水平)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: EmissiveBoost
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 4.5
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0.100000001
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.100000001
            Tooltip: HDR 自发光倍率 (促发辉光 Bloom)
            IsExposed: true
            ExposedName: EmissiveBoost
  - Name: RisingSmokePillar
    MaxParticles: 200
    Lifetime: 3
    EmissionRate: 25
    EmissionMode: 0
    SingleCount: 1
    Enabled: true
    Emitter:
      Type: Point
      LockToXY: false
      MeshPath: ""
    Material:
      TexturePath: textures/particles/smoke_puff.wtex
      MaterialPath: materials/particles/particle_alpha.wmat
      BlendMode: AlphaBlend
      FacingMode: Billboard
      EmissiveBoost: 1
      SoftParticle: false
      FadeDistance: 0.5
      SubUV:
        TilesX: 1
        TilesY: 1
        FPS: 0
        RandomStart: false
    Motion:
      Speed: 5
      SpeedVariance: 1
      Gravity: [0, -9.80000019, 0]
      LinearDrag: 0
      VortexStrength: 0
      VortexAxis: [0, 1, 0]
      TurbulenceStrength: 0
      TurbulenceFrequency: 1
    Evolution:
      SizeStart: 0.5
      SizeEnd: 0.100000001
      ColorStart: [1, 1, 1, 1]
      ColorEnd: [1, 1, 1, 0]
    Collision:
      Mode: None
      Restitution: 0.5
      Friction: 0.100000001
      KillOnHit: false
      EnableEvents: false
      PlaneOrigin: [0, 0, 0]
      PlaneNormal: [0, 1, 0]
    UseCustomShaderOverride: false
    Modules:
      - Id: mod.emitter.spawn_rate
        Name: 持续发射 (Spawn Rate)
        Description: 控制每秒持续发射的粒子数量 (火焰/浓烟/喷泉/火花流)
        Stage: Emitter
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: SpawnRate]\n    // 由系统发射调度器根据 SpawnRate 与 dt 累积并生成新图元\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: SpawnRate
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 25
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 20000
            Step: 1
            Tooltip: 每秒持续发射粒子数 (/s)
            IsExposed: true
            ExposedName: EmissionRate
      - Id: mod.spawn.init_particle
        Name: 粒子初始化 (Initialize Particle)
        Description: 设定图元诞生时的基准生命周期、初始尺寸与渐变颜色
        Stage: Spawn
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: InitializeParticle]\n    p.MaxLife = u_Lifetime;\n    p.Life = u_Lifetime;\n    p.Size = float2(u_SizeStart);\n    p.Color = u_ColorStart;\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: Lifetime
